      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Integration points",
      "items": [
        "skitour.fr: JSON API skitour.fr/api/sorties, header cle = SKITOUR_API_KEY (else disabled), ≤10 requests, 1.1 s apart; coordinates in the answer",
        "gulliver.it: WordPress REST wp-json/gulliver: mobile/commentglobal pages 1-5, mobile/comments?id= (≤15), mobile/routes?id= (≤24 new, cached), plus the HTML fragment front_page/comments?sorting=id; ≤45 requests, 2 s; Cloudflare blocks cloud addresses",
        "bivouak.net: HTML topos/liste_des_sorties.php?id_sport=1|2|8|4|16, then sortie pages for data-lat/data-lng (≤10 new); ≤15 requests, 10 s (robots.txt)",
        "gipfelbuch.ch: HTML /verhaeltnisse/uebersicht, then a report page per new summit for its map (≤15); ≤18 requests, 2 s",
        "skitourenportal.eu: HTML portal pages of 5 Austrian states, 2 pages each: table + map markers; ≤12 requests, 3 s",
        "on-ice.it: HTML over plain http, ISO-8859-1: onice_reports.php?type=0 (+ page 2), onice_view_report.php (≤15 new); ≤17 requests, 2 s; no coordinates, hints only"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "A run of a source",
      "items": [
        "Every partners.interval_minutes (15); blocked, down or failing raise PartnerRunFailed: backoff 1×, 2×, 4×… up to 16× the interval",
        "A failed lookup (one detail page, route or summit) degrades the run, it does not fail it; 3 in a row defer the rest",
        "Statuses in partner_sources: ok, degraded, failing, blocked, down, disabled (never_run when no row)"
      ]
    },
