        "GPX: only the points are kept (no time, heart rate, names), simplified over 2000 points; served with the author and CC BY-NC-ND",
        "Switches: harvest.partners.enabled and harvest.partners.<name>.enabled; bivouak, gipfelbuch, skitourenportal and onice off by default"
      ]
    },
